# Fargo Unisex Salon & Spa — environment setup
#
# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ CLIENT-SIDE (.env)                                   │
# │ Copy to .env and add your Supabase credentials.      │
# │ Find them: Supabase dashboard → Settings → API       │
# │                                                       │
# │ Only SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY go here.     │
# │ The anon key is public by design (enforced by RLS).  │
# │ NEVER put service_role, API keys, or secret keys     │
# │ in this file — they would be visible in the browser. │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ SERVER-SIDE ONLY (Supabase Edge Function secrets)    │
# │ Set these in:                                        │
# │   Supabase Dashboard → Edge Functions →              │
# │   send-notification → Settings → Secrets             │
# │                                                       │
# │ NEVER put these in .env, .env.local, or any file     │
# │ that gets bundled into client-side code.              │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# SUPABASE_URL               provided automatically inside the edge runtime
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  your service_role key (from Settings → API)
# RESEND_API_KEY             optional — enables email notifications via Resend
#
# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ SUPABASE MANAGEMENT API KEYS                         │
# │ These are for the Supabase Management API only.      │
# │ Do NOT put them in .env or any client-side file.     │
# │ Use them only in trusted server-side scripts.        │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# sb_publishable_...   ← Management API publishable key
# sb_secret_...        ← Management API secret key
